    "title": "Video: AFT COO Attacks Man, Threatens To Break His Neck (Updated) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago In the video seen below and posted multiple times in various versions by multiple people on Facebook, a young, apparently drunk spectator rides his bike onto the track at DuQuoin after-hours on July 4th and is attacked by American Flat Track (AFT) Chief Operating Officer (COO) David McGrath, who knocks the young man and his bike over. McGrath then jumps on the man and puts him into a choke hold, threatening “I’ll f–king break your f–king neck.” Read full article",
